# Shell chrome — locked decisions

## Split resident placement (human decision 2026-07-11)

Resident controls are **split** — do **not** remount the full
`AccountRailCluster` on `IconRail`.

### Header (`AppHeader.vue`)

1. Ghost logo (no fill chip) + breadcrumb/org chrome
2. Menubar (ambient only)
3. Zone presence avatars (`data-testid="zone-presence-avatars"`)
4. Slim `AccountRailCluster placement="header"` — **bell + capture only**

```vue
<AccountRailCluster v-if="user" placement="header" />
```

### Dock (`IconRail.vue`)

1. **Start:** `AdapterModeBadge` + `UserAccountMenu placement="rail"`
2. **Center:** nav icons (active = `bg-card`, no border)
3. **End:** `QuickCreateButton placement="rail"`

### Forbidden

- Mounting `<AccountRailCluster>` on `IconRail` (whole cluster)
- Putting presence avatars on the dock
- Zone-tint + border on active dock items (use `bg-card`, no border)

### Why agents regress

Older p0b specs cancelled dock-mount of the **full** cluster, then 2026-07-11
**split** avatar/`+` onto dock corners. Do not restore header-only avatar/+ or
remount the full cluster on the rail.

